        "username": "The_Girl_With_No_Nam",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/71e660/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-20T05:06:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dear The Source of Foes,</p>\n<p>Could you please go away?</p>\n<p>Signed,</p>\n<p>Literally everyone</p>\n<p>—————</p>\n<p>I don’t know what it is about this one shield in particular, but it seems nigh&nbsp;bleeding&nbsp;impossible to flip nine times out of ten. The only reason we got it&nbsp;last time we flipped it was because we&nbsp;literally had Omni-X and Rogue Agent KNYFE forcing the Aeon Man deck to play cards. Even then, we only flipped it in Game 2 with no spare environments and almost everyone dead.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Does anyone have any tips for this shield? It’s just so frigging annoying!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:35.044Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
