        "created_at": "2019-03-20T14:49:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My suggestion for this Shield is to have heroes try to stick with Aeon Master and plink him for more Aeon Men plays. &nbsp;It’s rough for sure since OblivAeon can easily wipe out any you’ve built up if you can’t take them out the same round. &nbsp;</p>",
